  "archived_at": "2026-11-14T07:39:34Z",
  "content_html": "<p>Moments after I posted my essay on why I couldn&#8217;t touch Anthropic&#8217;s IPO with a ten-foot pole, Anthropic&#8217;s CEO gave me (and everyone else) a reason to run away as fast as possible: a video tied to the IPO launch in which he made a bunch of overpromise about medicine that would have made Elizabeth Holmes blush.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/ns123abc/status/2120233187112636745?a=rP32-4q1yXVzy-rGIQI&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Anthropic CEO predicts cancer, Alzheimer's, heart disease, mental illness will be cured in less than 10 years \\n\\nACCELERATE &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;ns123abc&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;NIK&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2048822563821035520/7nxCFEnk_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-10T19:12:38.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Diua!,w_1028,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:best,fl_progressive:steep/l_play_button_usfui2,w_88,e_colorize:0/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F__ss-rehost__tw-video-preview-13_2120233136420270080.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/pHn6H5jx09&quot;}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:1289,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:1062,&quot;like_count&quot;:13346,&quot;impression_count&quot;:2446406,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:&quot;https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2120233136420270080/vid/avc1/1206x672/H6Dm2ChzT1NEar8F.mp4&quot;,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:&quot;13_2120233136420270080&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>As I have discussed before, this is not going to happen on anything remotely like that timeline. Cancer is more than one thing, and it will take more than a decade to eradicate it; the bit about curing mental illness (and some other things) that quickly is absolute fantasy.</p><p>The response from experts on X has been swift, and absolutely (and appropriately) brutal.</p><p>I was hardly the only one to get serious Elizabeth Holmes vibes.  Here are four of my favorites:</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/g_shullenberger/status/2120529189618983020?a=R38Oukm223Ykqbbz3MU&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;If you can&#8217;t see at least some parallels with Elizabeth Holmes here I don&#8217;t know what to tell you&#8230;&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;g_shullenberger&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Geoff Shullenberger&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2054629111360880640/ue2Dy_rK_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-11T14:48:50.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Anthropic CEO predicts cancer, Alzheimer's, heart disease, mental illness will be cured in less than 10 years \\n\\nACCELERATE&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;ns123abc&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;NIK&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2048822563821035520/7nxCFEnk_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[]},&quot;reply_count&quot;:202,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:897,&quot;like_count&quot;:8880,&quot;impression_count&quot;:122855,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/angie_rasmussen/status/2120633300054372809?a=pnoJHWaEGHtmoXt8iYU&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;We can test for every disease on earth with a single drop of blood&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;angie_rasmussen&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Dr. Angela Rasmussen&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/846727653637935104/oku_x_dt_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-11T21:42:32.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Anthropic CEO predicts cancer, Alzheimer's, heart disease, mental illness will be cured in less than 10 years \\n\\nACCELERATE&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;ns123abc&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;NIK&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2048822563821035520/7nxCFEnk_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[]},&quot;reply_count&quot;:104,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:616,&quot;like_count&quot;:16241,&quot;impression_count&quot;:264812,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/a_picazo/status/2120382382679502942?a=ukS23OWWetUBqDCHnIU&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;That's not how mental illness works, and frankly, the more fantastical promises/predictions these CEOs make, the stronger the case against trusting them or their product becomes.\\n\\nBig Elizabeth Holmes/Theranos vibes.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;a_picazo&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alheli Picazo&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1045831731511615488/erU9_N-T_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-11T05:05:29.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/HW0aevhWAAAqjsB.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/v4lgxa8U2c&quot;}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;In other news, AI will cure mental illness within a decade.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;JohnCassidy&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;John Cassidy&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1104913385714524167/tlnq04ew_normal.png&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[]},&quot;reply_count&quot;:29,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:47,&quot;like_count&quot;:300,&quot;impression_count&quot;:7569,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/charlottealter/status/2120566724189942226?a=g1DfTeHuDeenltfbM8Q&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Genuine Q: How is Amodei saying AI can cure cancer, Alzheimers, heart disease meaningfully different than Elizabeth Holmes saying Theranos \\&quot;can\\&quot; test blood?\\n\\nBoth are using \\&quot;can\\&quot; to mean: it may one day be possible. But she's a fraud and he's not?&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;CharlotteAlter&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Charlotte Alter&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1365428435334660101/KI8KlYvY_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-11T17:17:59.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Anthropic CEO predicts cancer, Alzheimer's, heart disease, mental illness will be cured in less than 10 years \\n\\nACCELERATE&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;ns123abc&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;NIK&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2048822563821035520/7nxCFEnk_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[]},&quot;reply_count&quot;:38,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:18,&quot;like_count&quot;:177,&quot;impression_count&quot;:7728,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>&#167;</p><p>The fact is, the field is in no position to do what Dario says, on anything like the timeline that he discusses. </p><p>On the one hand, we don&#8217;t have the data:</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/drrichjlaw/status/2120538524218699891?a=Bz9VtvALT2Hj8uC4KYs&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Stop it <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@DarioAmodei</span>. The data exists for &amp;lt;1% of biology. Likely AI will help get a few better drugs slightly faster &amp;amp; more efficiently in that time frame but honestly, especially with 5-8 years needed in the clinic, what you are saying is hyperbolic BS!&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;drrichjlaw&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rich Law&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1900110328446304256/6K3koO_e_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-11T15:25:56.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Anthropic CEO predicts cancer, Alzheimer's, heart disease, mental illness will be cured in less than 10 years \\n\\nACCELERATE&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;ns123abc&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;NIK&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2048822563821035520/7nxCFEnk_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[]},&quot;reply_count&quot;:74,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:51,&quot;like_count&quot;:517,&quot;impression_count&quot;:33456,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>What Dario said about timelines just ain&#8217;t happening.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/masterlongevity/status/2120632402083287183?a=bK4jQLVTwD7xGUBm3hs&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;<span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@megtirrell</span> <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@DarioAmodei</span> For the most recent 20 drugs approved, the mean time from 1st in human to fda approval was 14yrs.  The median was 10.  So unless these miracles drugs are are already in clinical testing or are very close to it, then the answer is a definite no. I do think there is a shot for ai&#8230;&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;masterlongevity&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;masterlongevity.&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1484975789502185474/rwdsC-DR_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-11T21:38:58.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:2,&quot;like_count&quot;:6,&quot;impression_count&quot;:507,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>As several researchers noted, we simply can&#8217;t expedite clinical trials &#8212; which are absolutely necessary &#8212;  to the degree that would be required:</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/docrodwong/status/2120641805750337641?a=GlxzrInV-orfBhwdjNc&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;<span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@megtirrell</span> <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@DarioAmodei</span> can someone send dario a drug dev gantt chart?  ;)  ...and just for context, i'm an AI bull, believe timelines will get a lot shorter, but we still have a process that has steps u aren't allowed to skip (like mouse experiments, manufacturing, fda interactions, and clinical&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;docrodwong&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rod Wong, MD&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1900281177564409856/ihcFI6-d_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-11T22:16:20.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:3,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:1,&quot;like_count&quot;:21,&quot;impression_count&quot;:1261,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/kirchuknicolas/status/2120693479559073996?a=fbGh6H4O2g0SldNUqNQ&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;<span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@megtirrell</span> <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@DarioAmodei</span> CEO of a precision oncology company here. Cured in under a decade? Clinical timelines alone make that very hard: a drug entering trials today reaches patients in the 2030s.\\n\\nWhat I do think is realistic: turning advanced cancer into a chronic disease people live with, like HIV.&#8230;&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;KirchukNicolas&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Nicolas Kirchuk&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2013082197385695232/xuLFqYYL_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-12T01:41:40.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:0,&quot;like_count&quot;:3,&quot;impression_count&quot;:178,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Practically anyone who works in the field knows what Dario said is bullshit. </p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/madscientist_sd/status/2120635432132366702?a=L7e80RSn8KyqERiiZ-4&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;<span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@megtirrell</span> <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@DarioAmodei</span> As a life long Cancer Biologist in Pharma industry, I call this BS.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;madscientist_SD&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Stephen Davis&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/656130786517757953/QPBhkG-f_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-11T21:51:01.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:0,&quot;like_count&quot;:6,&quot;impression_count&quot;:182,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Some of the pushback even came from prominent medical researchers who I would characterize as pretty pro AI..</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/erictopol/status/2120302576398958633?a=8ZPsEagdP8aiXyk9mr0&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Setting an unattainable objective. I wish it would come true, but curing all these diseases in the next 10 years is impossible. \\nAnd I'm very optimistic about the impact of AI for improving health.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;EricTopol&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Eric Topol&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1589325138960318464/2OwvQAWC_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-10T23:48:22.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Anthropic CEO predicts cancer, Alzheimer's, heart disease, mental illness will be cured in less than 10 years \\n\\nACCELERATE&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;ns123abc&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;NIK&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2048822563821035520/7nxCFEnk_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[]},&quot;reply_count&quot;:134,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:104,&quot;like_count&quot;:931,&quot;impression_count&quot;:126025,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Here&#8217;s the Chairman annd CEO of Eli Lilly, Dave Ricks, critiquing Dario and giving a far more realistic view:</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/davearicks/status/2120621798098358766?a=GC7hb_0ZH7F0v7hLnAs&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;I think that would be amazing and I think it&#8217;s not likely. The map of biology is still largely a blank page and randomized human proof is the long pole in the tent. I am excited about the use of AI in our sector but progress will likely be steady and  incremental.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;DaveARicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Dave A Ricks&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2093152443215306752/Oq9ste_Q_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-11T20:56:50.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;&#8220;Cancer, Alzheimer&#8217;s, heart disease, mental illness - these will be relics of the past in, I think, less than a decade.&#8221; &#8212; Anthropic CEO @DarioAmodei\\n\\nWhat do you think, bio folks?\\n\\nSource: https://t.co/GmtyTOpAoc&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;megtirrell&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Meg Tirrell&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1665795780710391811/pt7ILw3Z_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[]},&quot;reply_count&quot;:33,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:68,&quot;like_count&quot;:575,&quot;impression_count&quot;:88587,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>And here&#8217;s a professor of philosophy, stepping back to the larger context:</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/freganmitts/status/2120317136568807505?a=MCumGAjoKGGlvALx6Xo&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;If you do not see this man, and his peers, as cult leaders, you are a fool. They are playing all angles simultaneously&#8212;doomsday cult, healing miracles cult, secret knowledge cult, messianic cult&#8212;and it&#8217;s been effective.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;freganmitts&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Megan Fritts&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2023816101776232448/ljYMUkix_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-11T00:46:13.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Dario Amodei says cancer, Alzheimer&#8217;s, heart disease, and mental illness will be relics of the past in less than a decade, and that \\&quot;we can create an age of miracles\\&quot;\\n\\n&#8220;You know, if today we look at things like cancer, Alzheimer&#8217;s, heart disease, mental illness, these will be https://t.co/quRQbixDSu&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;firesidealpha&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Fireside Alpha&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2066254089756061697/MGnZGljz_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[]},&quot;reply_count&quot;:108,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:548,&quot;like_count&quot;:3842,&quot;impression_count&quot;:65446,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Letting this stuff slide is a mistake.</p><p>&#167;</p><p>The other part of the context, of course, is the IPO:</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/ramielghandour/status/2120509351752499240?a=3IWmwkB-n-q2zcmOuCw&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;I&#8217;ve taken two companies public. These are insane things to say in an IPO pitch and wreaks of desperation.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;RamiElghandour&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rami Elghandour&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1427444937805635585/vgNqf19e_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-11T13:30:01.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Anthropic CEO predicts cancer, Alzheimer's, heart disease, mental illness will be cured in less than 10 years \\n\\nACCELERATE&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;ns123abc&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;NIK&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2048822563821035520/7nxCFEnk_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[]},&quot;reply_count&quot;:95,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:74,&quot;like_count&quot;:697,&quot;impression_count&quot;:52883,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/garymarcus/status/2120659801805893963?a=KtbBrJ4Ykz3MvjraX6M&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;dario&#8217;s ipo speech was as full of shit as anything elizabeth holmes ever said \\n\\nsome investors never learn&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;GaryMarcus&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Gary Marcus&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2048405471900606464/kPeRHI2z_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-11T23:27:51.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;We can test for every disease on earth with a single drop of blood&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;angie_rasmussen&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Dr. Angela Rasmussen&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/846727653637935104/oku_x_dt_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[]},&quot;reply_count&quot;:9,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:46,&quot;like_count&quot;:419,&quot;impression_count&quot;:10288,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>&#167;</p><p>Despite the widespread ridicule of Dario&#8217;s Elizabeth-Holmesian claims, I have not noticed a single article deconstructing them in the major media.</p><p>In failing to call Dario out on his latest, immediately pre-IPO bullshit &#8212; which is so egregious it should be investigated for securities fraud &#8212; the media is failing the American public. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://garymarcus.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>P.S. You might need a tiny bit of technical background in software development to follow the below, but Dilbert couldn&#8217;t have captured the situation better:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zce_!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe46246af-ad14-4757-9ac9-f1e5d30c77f0_934x1986.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zce_!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe46246af-ad14-4757-9ac9-f1e5d30c77f0_934x1986.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zce_!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe46246af-ad14-4757-9ac9-f1e5d30c77f0_934x1986.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zce_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe46246af-ad14-4757-9ac9-f1e5d30c77f0_934x1986.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zce_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe46246af-ad14-4757-9ac9-f1e5d30c77f0_934x1986.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zce_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe46246af-ad14-4757-9ac9-f1e5d30c77f0_934x1986.png\" width=\"934\" height=\"1986\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e46246af-ad14-4757-9ac9-f1e5d30c77f0_934x1986.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1986,&quot;width&quot;:934,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:360798,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/224589004?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe46246af-ad14-4757-9ac9-f1e5d30c77f0_934x1986.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zce_!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe46246af-ad14-4757-9ac9-f1e5d30c77f0_934x1986.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zce_!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe46246af-ad14-4757-9ac9-f1e5d30c77f0_934x1986.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zce_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe46246af-ad14-4757-9ac9-f1e5d30c77f0_934x1986.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Zce_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe46246af-ad14-4757-9ac9-f1e5d30c77f0_934x1986.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p></p>",
